OL,3,GNEWSAQuadruple amputee 'starting to
OL,4,Afeel like me again'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA quadruple amputee has taken steps
OL,7,Fwithout the assistance of walking
OL,8,Fsticks for the first time after major
OL,9,Fsurgery.
OL,11,FLily McGarry, 25, from Jersey, went
OL,12,Finto septic shock after contracting
OL,13,Fmeningitis B while studying medicine at
OL,14,FCardiff University in 2025.
OL,16,FShe had to have all her limbs amputated
OL,17,Fto save her life and has been
OL,18,Fcontinuing her recovery in the island,
OL,19,Fincluding through free physiotherapy
OL,20,Fsessions, after moving back late last
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
